# Local, uncommitted real-API experiment output (ad-hoc diagnostic
# transcripts and scratch results, e.g. from experiments/agent_smoke.py or
# experiments/diagnostics/*.py). Structured results meant to be committed
# belong under results/agent/ instead (e.g. results/agent/runs.jsonl) --
# these patterns are intentionally narrow, not *.json/*.txt, so they never
# shadow that.
*_stdout.txt
*_results.json
clarify_*.txt
sample_*.txt
runtime_*.txt
experience_*.txt
b7d*_results.json
b7d*_stdout.txt
